      "$comment": "A third flight is doubly unreachable, so this case cannot isolate either rule. On the server the budget and the episode rule fire together, because one of the three Flight School heroes is always the episode 3 cut. In the planner that same cut leaves the third hero without a card, so visibility refuses the toggle before MAX_FLIGHT_TRAININGS ever would — the cap is defensive depth, not a reachable guard. A hand-written `?build=` link can still put three into state, which feature 001 allows and this feature answers with a 422.",
